OL,3,GNEWSAInjured walker rescued in 12-hour
OL,4,Aoperation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA walker with injuries to his head,
OL,7,Farms, back and legs has been carried to
OL,8,Fsafety after a 12-hour operation by
OL,9,Fmountain rescue teams.
OL,11,FThe alarm was raised just before 21:00
OL,12,FBST on Tuesday when shouts were heard
OL,13,Fat Red Ghyll, in the Lord's Rake area
OL,14,Fof the Lake District.
OL,16,FThere, a 43-year-old man had strayed
OL,17,Ffrom the path and ended up 150m (492ft)
OL,18,Fbelow it with a number of injuries,
OL,19,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
