OL,3,GNEWSAInjured walker rescued in 12-hour
OL,4,Aoperation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam leader Lee Johnson said the
OL,7,Fconditions on the fell were "brutal"
OL,8,Fand it was thought the man had been
OL,9,Flying below the path for nearly two
OL,10,Fhours before rescuers were alerted.
